=== Facebook Like and Share , Twitter , Google +1 , Google buzz buttons - new and easy ===
Contributors: Milos Lony
Tags: facebook, twitter, facebook share, twitter share, facebook share button, twitter share button,  google +1, +1, google buzz, buzz,  post, page
Requires at least: 3.0
Tested up to: 3.2.1
Stable tag: 1.2

Puts Facebook Like and Share,Twitter,Google +1,Google buzz buttons of your choice above or below your posts.

== Description ==

Puts Facebook Like and Share,Twitter,Google +1,Google buzz buttons of your choice above or below your posts.
Easy customization of active buttons and position in the Settings menu.

More info and Screenshots: http://emsphere.info/wp-plugin/facebook-like-and-sharetwittergoogle-1google-buzz-buttons.html


== Installation ==
1. Upload the `facebook-google` directory into the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Set your favourite values in the `Settings->facebook twittergoogle button` menu in Wordpress
3. Activate the plugin through the `Plugins` menu in WordPress
4. Enjoy!

 

